Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,設錯鬧鐘了 都過十點了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遲到了 預賽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6點01分 6點01分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 今天又迎來了 一個寒冷的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才六點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我調鬧鐘你都沒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊 晴希也起緊來吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美春阿姨做的飯最好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給 便當
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我特意多花了心思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飽肚子 好好加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 啦啦隊的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預賽加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:00:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早 晴子也來一起吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等下再吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思啊 她最近狀態不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狀態不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣 晴子她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.71,0:01:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近比賽一直沒贏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:42.15,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}結束漫不經心度過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:46.32,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}滿心想要脫離現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:51.95,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我總是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:56.12,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牽著我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:02:01.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}帶我去看新的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.30,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界變幻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:06.42,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邁出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.63,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛帶來了變化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:15.56,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再擔心 我們在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.10,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.68,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:21.90,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}雖然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:28.57,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不試試沒法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.07,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:35.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能觸碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.20,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我們不再孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:43.38,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:42.15,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:46.32,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:51.95,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:56.12,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:02:01.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.30,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:06.42,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.63,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:15.56,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.10,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.68,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:21.90,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:28.57,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.07,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:35.08,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:38.20,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:43.38,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之大家先冷靜些
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好激動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼大家都看著我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看的是你的鳥窩頭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的 幸虧弄了個爆炸頭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家是沒見過全是男生的隊伍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硌得難受 又硌得難受
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也吃多了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥 我去廁所
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一緊張就愛跑廁所 這毛病什麼時候能改
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 眼暈了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俺要回鄉下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太丟人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一輩子一次的大舞臺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是男人就該華麗地凋零
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 凋零了咋整
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 那些女生的發飾好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們都給我振作起來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太丟人了 別心神不寧的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教練
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早 都到齊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們報名的大學生組預賽合格的基準分是80分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要沒有大的失誤 我們的表演足夠合格了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼開幕式就快開始了 準備去會場吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝教練
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 我能集中精神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:43.28,上标,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 阿晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.31,0:04:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有點嚇人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越正常的人越容易崩潰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去下廁所 你們先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德川
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩的傢伙來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來你終於願意站到台前來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過一個全男生的啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別以為這種隊伍能贏過我們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 原來你不認識啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 他是SPARKS的...那個誰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你退出啦啦隊後
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如彗星一般出現在陽明大學SPARKS的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超級明星 奇跡王牌花咲薫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找我什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我會證明給你看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我在的SPARKS才是最強的隊伍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花咲 別說了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本前輩 好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高興你回歸啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我期待你今天的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子最近比賽一直沒贏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧 看你臉色不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事 多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐你邊上咯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次參加正式比賽很緊張吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那時也是 緊張得快流鼻血了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都是為了今天才拼命訓練那麼久
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然是想贏啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴？ 是不是身體不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-抱歉         -阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開幕式開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們都要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比賽開始前幽會 你很淡定嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉糜？ 便當是漢堡肉餅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 沒事吧 如果你是為了今天早上...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面 全國啦啦隊錦標賽關東預賽即將開賽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表演開始前希望你們記住一點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天在這個會場的任何一個人都不是你們的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是為你們加油的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的不是輸贏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是做出自己最好的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 姐姐一定沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你腦子很亂 但現在把精力都集中在表演上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 阿晴一定沒問題 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一組 命志院大學 BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中 集中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連勝中斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子最近比賽一直沒贏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.93,0:09:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 別總是垂頭喪氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史 我今天的表現怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小失誤不斷 一點都不像平時的你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能通過預賽真開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好緊張啊 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和舞蹈比賽完全不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛超過基準分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正只要過了就不在話下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的翻轉比想像的好很多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我們的水準還是不夠好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能通過預賽是大家努力的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就該慶祝 明開開始繼續訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔在大舞臺的表演還是那麼穩定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我也緊張得很
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能順利演完我也很慶倖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 翔 去報名正式比賽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保管好報名表 別弄丟了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 堂本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝賀你們通過預賽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:29.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被今天表現最好的隊伍的隊長這麼一說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情很複雜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 也祝賀你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我還不能認可你們的表現
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS的表演就像馬戲團
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實看起來有模有樣 技巧也完成得不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你們還不明白啦啦隊最重要的東面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:10:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不行 重來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們到底想不想練
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距離全國錦標賽就剩不到一個月了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有時間休息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是做不出更高水準的完美表演
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全國大賽根本沒戲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的或許沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但要是練得太狠受了傷 還怎麼比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.39,0:11:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我們不能就這樣下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說我們像馬戲團 他又...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼覺得翔最近怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 預賽結束後簡直一碰就炸的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也是一練完就回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:11:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對勁的不止翔一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也穿成那樣回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個個都沒法吐槽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教練
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 星期天你倆出來買東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛去給棒球部加油 才回來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次很抱歉 我不該說那些話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 為什麼堂本隊長要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你總是這樣動不動就道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你問翔的話 他就好像回到了那時候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔？ 德川他怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本不在乎他 無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:13:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一支外行隊伍能通過預賽 我覺得他已經做得不錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我根本無所謂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔現在仍在為參加啦啦隊而感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也難怪 畢竟是他引發了那樣的意外
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那次意外 不只是翔一個人的過失
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個客人都沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可怎麼是好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算什麼 松鼠次郎展？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打工辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在高考在即 大家都緊張得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和咱們的教頭有的一拼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:13:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人都說來著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預賽結束後 翔變得特別斯巴達
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以現在的水準無法立足於全國比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你應該明白這一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不是抱怨你太嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼都不問未必永遠是正確的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你正獨自為什麼事情煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們想為你分擔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本前輩曾經是我和櫻的偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 完美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:41.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁前輩 下次請教我Walk in Extension吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別著急 慢慢提升技能就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能不急 仁前輩就要畢業了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在大學的SPARKS等你們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你們這代的夏日杯 可得用冠軍來收尾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我們一定拿冠軍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請務必來觀賽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本引退後當上隊長的櫻和成了教頭的翔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一門心思投入訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周圍人也在他們的感染下 不斷提升著隊伍水準
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當時只要是高中的啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人不知道德川高城組合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在夏日杯前夕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想提升整體技巧的難度
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏日杯下周就要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想拿冠軍就得挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一定能做到 一定要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們還不明白對啦啦隊而言什麼才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的啦啦隊表演就是馬戲團
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不行 重來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子 搖籃的姿勢太鬆散
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不是驚險吸引眼球的馬戲團
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底座接人的時候別晃 動作幅度太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,單單做高難度技巧是提升不了技術分的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不能表演得更完美 就沒法得冠軍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不是馬戲團
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那次意外我也有責任
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了多少遍 不是你的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 抬起頭來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對於高難度的競技啦啦隊充滿自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我並沒有忘記啦啦隊原本的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要做出高水準的完美表演
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,證明我已經振作起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本說像馬戲團 他真的是那個意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊真的是那樣的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德川 你要猶豫到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.39,0:17:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光...臨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花咲薫 SPARKS的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是看你不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知不知道大家有多擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家憑什麼都支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別讓大家擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫他們安心下來行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本隊長 高城教練 還有櫻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後和我比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的意思應該是堂本現在不放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓觀眾感覺「驚險」和不安的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和馬戲團是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你們為我做的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啦啦隊而言最重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是為觀看的人加油 讓他們露出笑容才對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堂本隊長剛才也是那樣說的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...還是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須在全國大賽上做出完美的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否則我沒臉面對櫻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼還說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你又知道些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻直到現在依然默默支持著你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我問了高城教練
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻總是拜託教練拍下訓練的視頻發給她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時別告訴翔 以後我會解釋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去見櫻 跟她聊聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔能跟她好好談一談嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你現在最想讓誰露出笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼突然來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來見櫻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一直在等你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的品味還是那麼糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔 看著我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.67,0:20:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是要被你氣死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不經我允許擅自退出啦啦隊 你可真做得出來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要是你躲起來一蹶不振
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就得把你找到 拖出來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧我複健太積極 馬上就能走路了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還和以前一樣 最拿手的是接人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直看著你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你醉心啦啦隊的樣子 我自己也深受鼓舞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻 一直以來真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定會自己走去賽場為你加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和櫻聊過了 向她道歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.07,0:21:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來喵...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下著雪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照這樣下去 我永遠贏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.84,0:22:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:21.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}想對你說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:23.31,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:24.94,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.43,0:22:26.56,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.65,0:22:29.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:34.99,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大聲回應
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:38.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,嶄新大門打開的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:41.70,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像緊緊握住的拳頭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:45.00,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,決意堅定地響起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.46,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散發的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:51.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話感覺能改變些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:54.72,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你總是在尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:58.14,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:23:01.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:04.85,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自棄＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.73,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要輸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.31,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上應援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:12.94,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打氣的動作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:16.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:19.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂頭喪氣抱怨「到極限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:23.25,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破極限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:26.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS ＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.75,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.09,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利的姿勢＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.22,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,連同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:40.05,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著邂逅閃耀笑容的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:42.97,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:47.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:34.99,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:38.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:41.70,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:45.00,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.46,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:51.83,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:54.72,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:58.14,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:23:01.60,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:04.85,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.73,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.31,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:12.94,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:16.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:19.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:23.25,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:26.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.75,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.09,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.22,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:40.05,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.52,0:23:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴很期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:23:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也好想要手工巧克力蛋糕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:23:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔跟你說的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.95,0:24:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今年可能沒收穫了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 應該能收到一個
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 有苦有甜的情人節
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
